    },
    {
      "id": "6a8577ed00000000004e7f76",
      "text": "https://word-galaxy.net",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787131864,
      "updated": 1787131865
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8577ef00000000004e7f78",
      "text": "[https://gyazo.com/42f4cbff0a7a2a964e4e47827407edd8]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787131866,
      "updated": 1787132406
    },
    {
      "id": "6a857a0a00000000004e7f80",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787132404,
      "updated": 1787132404
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85780a00000000004e7f79",
      "text": " [英単語]の[語幹]をノード形式で表現する[Webアプリ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787131893,
      "updated": 1787136764
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8579a200000000004e7f7f",
      "text": "  単語の語幹と、語幹の共通する単語の例がノード形式でつながって表示される",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787132300,
      "updated": 1787132344
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85782e00000000004e7f7a",
      "text": "  Ex. educational はこれらに分解",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787131929,
      "updated": 1787132038
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85788600000000004e7f7b",
      "text": "   e-(外へ)",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787132017,
      "updated": 1787132050
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85788900000000004e7f7c",
      "text": "   duc(導く)",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787132020,
      "updated": 1787132061
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85788d00000000004e7f7d",
      "text": "   -ation(こと)",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787132023,
      "updated": 1787132075
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85789100000000004e7f7e",
      "text": "   -al(性質)",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787132027,
      "updated": 1787132092
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85ce1b0000000000d63def",
      "text": "  [語幹で終わる文の形のリンク]だ[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1787153947,
      "updated": 1787153951
    },
    {
      "id": "6a857a6500000000004e7f82",
      "text": " [ノード]をホバーすると追加情報が表示される",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787132495,
      "updated": 1787136751
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8577ee00000000004e7f77",
      "text": "  語幹(緑色)は意味",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787131865,
      "updated": 1787132533
    },
    {
      "id": "6a857a8c00000000004e7f84",
      "text": "  [関連語](青色)は語幹の構造",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787132534,
      "updated": 1787136779
    },
    {
      "id": "6a857afc00000000004e7f85",
      "text": "   クリックすることでその語のページに飛ぶことができる",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1787132646,
      "updated": 1787132675
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8579b3000000000078bccb",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787132339,
      "updated": 1787132339
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85ad660000000000bcf038",
      "text": "[hoagecko.icon]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1787145574,
      "updated": 1787145577
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85ad6b0000000000bcf03c",
      "text": " 作者さん？の解説記事らしきもの",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1787145580,
      "updated": 1787145588
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85ad660000000000bcf039",
      "text": "\t [https://note.com/mokayoshi/n/nf0b3b8aa41ee 【Webアプリ】英単語の語源を星座のように「みえる化」してみた話｜おかよし]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1787145574,
      "updated": 1787145588
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85ad820000000000bcf03d",
      "text": "\t おかよし さんは獣医師らしく、だからサイトに医学系の言葉が収録されているっぽい",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1787145602,
      "updated": 1787145629
    },
    {
